issippi/pearl-river-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids November to December came in under 90% of normal in 40 of them. In 2025 the middle ran 52% of normal in September to October and 57% of normal in October to November. So far in 2026 the middle went the other way, with May to June at 229% of normal. Grid 13063 had its driest year in 2000 at 62%.</p>"}
